<title>USA: U.S. defense stockpile sold 405 tonnes tin.</title>
<headline>U.S. defense stockpile sold 405 tonnes tin.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Defense Logistics Agency said Monday that it sold 405 tonnes of stockpile tin to three bidders at $2.71 per lb.</p>
<p>The DLA said it sold 200 tonnes each to RMT, N.Y., and APOA, Chadds Ford, Pa. It sold five tonnes to Roto Metals, San Francisco.</p>
<p>The DLA sold the tin in its daily offering program to sell tin from the defense stockpile.</p>
